        "D=finrankℂ eHom, the image after postcomposition by R_e of continuous archimedean intertwiners into automorphic L².",
        "K(x,z)=Σ_{γ∈G(F)} φ(x⁻¹γz). The φ factor is the product of formal degrees times the conjugated product of matrix coefficients times e at the finite component.",
        "c₀=(∏_v d_v) Re e(1), V=μ(F), M=c₀V. Here F in μ(F) denotes the fundamental domain, while G(F) uses the underlying number field."
