      "statement": "For n≥exp(15), f≥1, the four-term bound implies |D−M|≤exp(−nf log n/16)M. The family comparison gives the same bilateral estimate for (Dall,Dstar), with n=r. The frame takes Dall≤(1+exp(−rf log r/16))Dstar.",
